            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The following chapter examines some of the current &quot;state-of-the-art&quot; tools for predicting, scoring, and examining explicit water molecules in proteins and protein/ligand complexes, highlighting some of the ways information can be readily examined in a manner that is useful in a drug discovery process.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
